sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User Browser
    participant Istio as Istio Gateway<br/>:80/TCP
    participant BFF as UI BFF<br/>:8080/TCP<br/>Optional TLS 1.3
    participant Registry as model-registry proxy<br/>:8080/TCP<br/>Istio mTLS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>:5432/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Controller<br/>:8081/TCP health
    participant CSI as mr-storage-initializer
    participant S3 as S3 / OCI Storage<br/>:443/TCP HTTPS
    participant AsyncJob as async-upload Job<br/>(Python)
    participant Catalog as model-catalog-server<br/>:8080/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>:443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User, DB: Flow 1: Model Registration via UI

    User->>Istio: POST /api/v1/model_registry/:id/registered_models<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Istio->>BFF: VirtualService routing<br/>HTTP
    BFF->>BFF: Auth middleware validates token<br/>(internal SA or user_token mode)
    BFF->>Registry: POST /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>Istio mTLS, SA Token
    Registry->>DB: INSERT registered_model<br/>SQL, Username/Password
    DB-->>Registry: OK
    Registry-->>BFF: 201 Created
    BFF-->>Istio: JSON Response
    Istio-->>User: Model registered

    Note over K8sAPI, Registry: Flow 2: InferenceService Sync

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch InferenceService events<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    Controller->>Controller: Check INFERENCE_SERVICE_CONTROLLER=managed
    Controller->>Registry: GET/PATCH /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/*<br/>HTTP, SA Token
    Registry->>DB: UPDATE model version status<br/>SQL
    DB-->>Registry: OK
    Registry-->>Controller: Sync complete

    Note over CSI, S3: Flow 3: Model Serving (CSI Storage Initializer)

    CSI->>Registry: GET model artifact URI<br/>model-registry:// protocol<br/>HTTP :8080
    Registry-->>CSI: Artifact location (S3/OCI URI)
    CSI->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS :443, Storage credentials
    S3-->>CSI: Model files

    Note over User, S3: Flow 4: Async Model Upload

    User->>BFF: POST /api/v1/model_registry/:id/model_versions/:vid/upload<br/>Bearer Token
    BFF->>K8sAPI: Create Job (async-upload)<br/>HTTPS :6443, User Token
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Job created
    BFF-->>User: Upload initiated
    AsyncJob->>S3: Download from source<br/>HTTPS :443, Credentials
    S3-->>AsyncJob: Model artifacts
    AsyncJob->>AsyncJob: sigstore model signing
    AsyncJob->>S3: Upload to destination<br/>HTTPS :443, Credentials
    AsyncJob->>Registry: Register model artifact<br/>HTTP :8080, SA Token
    Registry->>DB: INSERT model_artifact
    DB-->>Registry: OK

    Note over Catalog, HF: Flow 5: Catalog Discovery

    User->>Istio: GET /api/v1/model_catalog/models<br/>Bearer Token
    Istio->>BFF: VirtualService routing
    BFF->>Catalog: GET /api/model_catalog/*<br/>HTTP
    Catalog->>HF: Fetch model metadata<br/>HTTPS :443, API Key
    HF-->>Catalog: Model metadata
    Catalog-->>BFF: Aggregated catalog results
    BFF-->>User: Catalog models
